      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It's just my speculation, but I think this problem is related to https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/cant-favouriteunfavourite-avatars\n\nWhen uploading new world it dosen't update to vrchat right away, when it finaly updates and I invite my friends from old version instance to new one they go to new instance, but old version of world.\n\nSame with avatars. When updating avatar it may take really long time before it updates to VRChat, but it will.\n\nAnd... its common to see friends online even if they area offline; see friends on diffirent world where they accually are (some cases have been there over 15minutes before)\n\nSounds like caching problem for me\n\nBUT, I don't have noticed these problems on last week",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
